<title>UK: SNS Bank sets 250 mln guilder 12-year bond.</title>
<headline>SNS Bank sets 250 mln guilder 12-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett</p>
<p> BORROWER   SNS BANK NEDERLAND</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    17.JUL.09</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.375   PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.90     SPREAD	+55 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A2	  LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 5-100-1M  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N/LANDS</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.525     SELL CONC  1.465     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658  </p>
<p> NOTES	SNS FINANCIAL MARKETS IS JOINT LEAD MANAGER</p>
